Did you have yet another bag to actually use?  It seems like a rather 
destructive way to ID an item.  Once you know they're not cursed, a bag 
of holding can easily be IDed by picking up enough that you are just 
burdened, then putting some stuff in.  If you are no longer burdened, it 
was a BoH (Check for BoTricks first by #looting).  That way, you don't 
waste a useful item to find out what it is.  If you aren't sure whether 
it's cursed, put rocks/junk armour in and see if they get heavier.

